#: site/lectures/12-databases.md:658
msgid "`pd.read_sql(sql, connection)` gives the result of a query as a pandas table. It comes in [lecture 14](./14-pandas-select-aggregate-join.md#_7-from-a-database-into-a-dataframe), when you know DataFrames."
msgstr ""

